<title>FINLAND: NIINISTO TO GO TO LONDON TO MEET INVESTORS, BANKERS.</title>
<headline>NIINISTO TO GO TO LONDON TO MEET INVESTORS, BANKERS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto will travel to London on November 5 to meet international investors and bankers, the finance ministry said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>During the two-day visit, Niinisto will on five separate occasions meet &quot;leaders of the most important investor groups and banks from Great Britain, America and Japan,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Talks would focus on the market outlook and international economic trends, it said, but did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Among the officials travelling with Niinisto will be the ministry's head of financing Kari Nars and financing counsellor Inga-Maria Grohn, the ministry said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
